# particle.example.com — the Particle Editor demo site (static).
#
# ⚠️ REFERENCE COPY. Source-of-truth for this vhost fragment moved to
# **DrKnickers/vps-infra** (`caddy/conf.d/particle.caddy`) in Phase 2 (2026-07-13).
# Edit the vhost there via a vps-infra PR (which runs `caddy validate` in CI),
# then the admin deploy path installs it. Do NOT hand-edit the host copy or
# treat this file as authoritative — keep it in sync with vps-infra if you touch it.
#
# The vhost is a drop-in fragment at /etc/caddy/conf.d/particle.caddy, pulled in by
# the root Caddyfile's `import /etc/caddy/conf.d/*.caddy` (so a Caddyfile
# re-sync/restore never wipes our routing). Fragment installs go through the
# vps-infra admin deploy path (NOT particledeploy, which can't write /etc/caddy).
#
# This repo still owns the SITE CONTENT: /var/www/particle-editor-demo
# (root site + /guide + /media-local), deployed by particledeploy.

particle.example.com {
	root * /var/www/particle-editor-demo
	encode gzip
	file_server
}
